          "content": {
            "size": 1975,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"draft_id\":\"\",\"cached\":false,\"subject\":\"Practice between ESL lessons\",\"body\":\"Hi Maja,\\n\\nSaw Foreign Language School runs ESL alongside German, Spanish and Mandarin. That is a lot of plates to keep spinning.\\n\\nI am with PrimKeet. We turn vocabulary, speaking, reading and grammar into games ESL learners play between lessons. Points, badges, leaderboards. You assign, they practice, you track progress.\\n\\nHappy to set your class up with a game set and see how it lands.\\n\\nWant me to send details?\\n\\nBest,\",\"highlights\":[{\"text\":\"Saw Foreign Language School runs ESL alongside German, Spanish and Mandarin.\",\"kind\":\"research\",\"title\":\"Lead's course lineup\",\"explanation\":\"Uses the research showing the school offers ESL plus German, Spanish and Mandarin courses, grounding the opener in a real detail about the lead.\",\"sources\":[\"company_name\",\"company_description\"]},{\"text\":\"We turn vocabulary, speaking, reading and grammar into games ESL learners play between lessons.\",\"kind\":\"research\",\"title\":\"Matches ESL practice pain\",\"explanation\":\"Mirrors the segment's pain point that students need practice between lessons and the offer's vocabulary, speaking, reading and grammar game coverage.\",\"sources\":[\"pain\",\"offer\"]},{\"text\":\"You assign, they practice, you track progress.\",\"kind\":\"research\",\"title\":\"Matches tracking need\",\"explanation\":\"Speaks to the segment's need to assign game practice, reinforce vocabulary and grammar, and track progress.\",\"sources\":[\"pain\",\"keywords\"]},{\"text\":\"Happy to set your class up with a game set and see how it lands.\\n\\nWant me to send details?\",\"kind\":\"instructions\",\"title\":\"Low-friction reply CTA\",\"explanation\":\"\",\"sources\":[\"Close with a low-friction reply-based CTA. Never push a cold call or a \\\"15-minute call\\\", and never use a gimmick like \\\"reply with <keyword>\\\".\"]}],\"language_used\":\"English\",\"language_reason\":\"The company is based in the US and serves international students, so English is the business language.\"}"
          },
